desc: Lucifera (Valley Feline port) by chmaha
tags: filter lowpass bandpass state-variable OTA analog stereo
author: chmaha
version: 1.1
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
about:
  Stereo 2/4-pole OTA lowpass or bandpass filter with resonance, input drive and left/right cutoff spacing.
  Ported from Valley Feline by Dale Johnson (ValleyRackFree, https://github.com/ValleyAudio/ValleyRackFree,
  GPLv3+). Track audio feeds the left and right inputs (full scale = 10 V); the Output switch picks the L/R jacks or the Mix jack.
  Title lettering: Zarathustra by Lorene Ceccon (SIL Open Font License 1.1), rendered into the panel image.
  Sidebar picture: Alphonse Mucha, "Étoile du matin" (The Morning Star) from "La Lune et les étoiles", 1902, public domain
  (Bibliothèque nationale de France, Gallica btv1b90077190, via Wikimedia Commons).
  JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaPanel.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaPanel2x.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaImage.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaImage2x.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaImage-LICENSE.txt
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaTitle.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaTitle2x.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaRays.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaTop.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaTop2x.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaGlow.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaGlow2x.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaFig.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaShafts.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaHaze.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaDot.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaBlink.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaBlink2x.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaCloth.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaCloth2x.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaClothBase.png
  Dependencies/Lucifera/LuciferaClothBase2x.png
